hadiths[32]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qazi teen hain: do aag mein aur ek jannat mein. Woh aadmi jis ne haq pahchana aur us se faisla kiya woh jannat mein hai. Aur woh aadmi jis ne haq pahchana magar us se faisla na kiya aur hukm mein zulm kiya woh aag mein hai. Aur woh aadmi jis ne haq na pahchana aur logon ke liye jahalat par faisla kiya woh aag mein hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaza ka wali banaya gaya woh baghair chhuri zabah kiya gaya. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1190","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum anqareeb imarat par hirs karoge, aur woh qayamat ke din nadamat hogi; to doodh pilane wali achchi hai aur doodh chhudane wali buri hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1191","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab hakim hukm kare aur ijtihad kare phir durust ho to us ke liye do ajr hain; aur jab hukm kare aur ijtihad kare phir khata kare to us ke liye ek ajr hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi do ke darmiyan faisla na kare jabke woh gusse mein ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"1193","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas do aadmi muqadma laen to pahle ke liye faisla na karo yahan tak ke doosre ki baat suno; phir tum janoge ke kaise faisla karte ho. Ali ne kaha: Phir main us ke baad hamesha qazi raha. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha; aur Ibn Madini ne ise qawi kaha; aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha. Aur is ka shahid Hakim ke han Ibn Abbas ki hadees se hai."
"1194","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mere paas jhagadte hue aate ho, aur shayad tum mein se ba'z apni daleel mein ba'z se ziyada tez-zaban ho; to main use us par faisla dun jo main us se sunta hun. To jis ke liye main us ke bhai ke haq mein se kuch kaat dun to main use aag ka tukda kat-ta hun. Muttafaq alaih."
"1195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh ummat kaise pak hogi jis mein taqatwar se kamzor ke liye na liya jae? Ise Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya; aur is ka shahid Buraidah ki hadees se Bazzar ke han hai; aur doosra Abu Sa'id ki hadees se Ibn Majah ke han hai."
"1196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qayamat ke din adil qazi bulaya jaega aur hisab ki sakhti se woh paega ke woh tamanna karega ke us ne apni umar mein do ke darmiyan faisla na kiya hota. Ise Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya aur Baihaqi ne ise nikala, aur un ke alfaz hain: Khajur mein."
"1197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Woh qaum kabhi kamyab na hogi jis ne apna mamla aurat ko saunp diya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1198","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Maryam Azdi (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jise Allah Musalmanon ke mamle mein se kuch ka wali banae aur woh un ki hajat aur faqeer se parda kare to Allah us ki hajat se parda karega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"1199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisle mein rishwat dene wale aur lene wale par la'nat ki. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ka shahid Abdullah bin Amr ki hadees se Arba'a ke han Nasai ke siwa hai."
"1200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke dono fareeq hakim ke samne baithen. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhen behtareen gawahon ke bare mein na bataun? Woh jo apni gawahi mange jane se pahle lae. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein behtareen mera zamana hai, phir jo un se milte hain, phir jo un se milte hain; phir aisi qaum hogi jo gawahi degi jabke un se gawahi na mangi gayi hogi, khayanat karegi aur ameen na banayi jaegi, nazr manegi aur poori na karegi, aur un mein motapa zahir hoga. Muttafaq alaih."
"1203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khain mard ya khain aurat ki gawahi jaez nahin hai, na apne bhai par keena rakhne wale ki, aur ghar walon ke khadim ki gawahi jaez nahin hai. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"1204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Dehati ki gawahi shehri par jaez nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"1205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne khutba diya aur kaha: Beshak kuch log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein wahi se pakde jate the; aur beshak wahi qat' ho chuki hai; aur beshak ham ab tumhen us se pakdenge jo ham par tumhare a'mal se zahir ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1206","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne jhooti gawahi ko kabira gunahon mein ginaya. Muttafaq alaih ek hadees mein."
"1207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se farmaya: Kya tum suraj dekhte ho? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Is jaisi par gawahi do ya chhor do. Ise Ibn Adi ne za'if sanad se nikala, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha magar khata ki."
"1208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam aur gawah se faisla farmaya. Ise Muslim ne nikala; aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne, aur Nasai ne kaha: Is ki sanad achchi hai."
"1209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar logon ko un ke da'we se diya jata to log aadmiyon ke khoon aur maal ka da'wa karte; lekin qasam mudi'a alaih par hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Baihaqi ke han sahih sanad se hai: Gawah mudi'i par hai, aur qasam us par jo inkar kare."
"1211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek qaum par qasam pesh ki to woh jaldi karne lage. To Aap ne hukm diya ke un ke darmiyan qasam mein qura dala jae ke un mein se kaun qasam khae. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah Harisi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman aadmi ka haq apni qasam se kaate Allah ne us ke liye aag wajib kar di hai aur us par jannat haram kar di hai. To ek aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Agarche mamuli cheez ho Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche araak ki tehni ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam par qasam khae jis se Musalman aadmi ka maal kaate jabke woh us mein jhoota ho to Allah se is haal mein milega ke Woh us par ghazabnak hoga. Muttafaq alaih."
"1214","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke do aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek janwar mein jhagadte hue aae jabke un mein se kisi ke paas gawah na tha. To Rasulullah ne us ke darmiyan aadha aadha faisla farmaya. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur yeh unhi ke alfaz hain; aur Nasai ne kaha: Is ki sanad achchi hai."
"1215","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mere is mimbar par gunahgar qasam khae woh apna thikana aag mein banae. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam na karega, na un ki taraf dekhega, na unhen pak karega, aur un ke liye dardnak azab hai: woh aadmi jo jungle mein zaroorat se ziyada pani par ho aur use musafir se roke; aur woh aadmi jis ne Asr ke baad aadmi se saman becha aur us ke liye Allah ki qasam khai ke use itne itne mein liya hai, to us ne us ki tasdeeq ki jabke woh us ke siwa tha; aur woh aadmi jis ne imam se bai'at ki aur siwae duniya ke us se bai'at na kare: agar use us mein se de to wafa kare, aur agar use us mein se na de to wafa na kare. Muttafaq alaih."
"1217","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke do aadmi untni mein jhagde; to un mein se har ek ne kaha ke mere paas paida hui hai, aur gawah qaem kiye. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke haq mein faisla farmaya jis ke hath mein woh thi."
"1218","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam haq mangne wale ki taraf lotai. Dono ko Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur un donon ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"1219","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din khush hote hue mere paas aae jabke Aap ke chehre ki lakeeren chamak rahi thin. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne Mujazziz Mudliji ko nahin dekha? Us ne abhi Zaid bin Harisah aur Usamah bin Zaid ko dekha. To us ne kaha: Yeh qadam ek doosre mein se hain. Muttafaq alaih."
